  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0.94,
      "text": "What if Naruto joined the"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.94,
      "end": 1.8,
      "text": "Akatsuki?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.8,
      "end": 2.98,
      "text": "Oh, fantastic."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.98,
      "end": 3.86,
      "text": "Our boy saw matching villain"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.86,
      "end": 6.0,
      "text": "cloaks and thought, career opportunity."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.0,
      "end": 7.14,
      "text": "Motherflicker, they are hunting the"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.14,
      "end": 8.12,
      "text": "fox inside you."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.12,
      "end": 8.82,
      "text": "That is not a job"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.82,
      "end": 9.48,
      "text": "interview."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.48,
      "end": 10.24,
      "text": "You are the lunch."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.24,
      "end": 11.58,
      "text": "In this made -up timeline,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.58,
      "end": 12.48,
      "text": "he bargains for his friends'"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.48,
      "end": 13.7,
      "text": "safety. Fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.7,
      "end": 14.5,
      "text": "But the cloak comes with"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.5,
      "end": 16.18,
      "text": "suspiciously aggressive management."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.18,
      "end": 17.32,
      "text": "Pain calls it peace."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.32,
      "end": 18.16,
      "text": "The village gets a demolition"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.16,
      "end": 19.1,
      "text": "notice."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.1,
      "end": 20.24,
      "text": "Naruto says, can we maybe"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.24,
      "end": 21.63724903776081,
      "text": "try a conversation first?"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.63724903776081,
      "end": 22.477249999999998,
      "text": "And Obito?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.477249999999998,
      "end": 23.59725,
      "text": "Mask on."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.59725,
      "end": 24.59725,
      "text": "Accountability off."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.59725,
      "end": 26.09725,
      "text": "Absolutely excellent hiring department."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.09725,
      "end": 27.59725,
      "text": "At first, missions go well."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.59725,
      "end": 29.25725,
      "text": "Our boy finally feels respected."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.25725,
      "end": 30.457250000000002,
      "text": "Then comes the assignment: betray"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.457250000000002,
      "end": 31.69725,
      "text": "the Hidden Leaf. Brother."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.69725,
      "end": 32.63725,
      "text": "That is your home."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.63725,
      "end": 33.73725,
      "text": "Read the stupid contract."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.73725,
      "end": 34.89725,
      "text": "He refuses."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.89725,
      "end": 35.777249999999995,
      "text": "Suddenly the new team questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.777249999999995,
      "end": 36.65725,
      "text": "his loyalty."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.65725,
      "end": 38.45725,
      "text": "Sakura is left picking through rubble."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.45725,
      "end": 39.45725,
      "text": "Some protection plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.45725,
      "end": 40.557249999999996,
      "text": "Even his old friends cannot"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.557249999999996,
      "end": 41.86853337011438,
      "text": "tell whose side he is on."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.86853337011438,
      "end": 43.6685625,
      "text": "Congratulations, genius."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.6685625,
      "end": 45.188562499999996,
      "text": "Two teams, zero trust, absolutely"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.188562499999996,
      "end": 46.6285625,
      "text": "no dental insurance."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.6285625,
      "end": 47.7085625,
      "text": "So he stops chasing approval"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.7085625,
      "end": 49.1285625,
      "text": "and chooses his people."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.1285625,
      "end": 50.6085625,
      "text": "The Akatsuki wanted a weapon."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.6085625,
      "end": 51.5285625,
      "text": "They got an argument."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.5285625,
      "end": 53.308562499999994,
      "text": "Could he actually change them? Maybe."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.308562499999994,
      "end": 54.2485625,
      "text": "This is Naruto."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.2485625,
      "end": 55.688562499999996,
      "text": "But friendship speeches cannot fix"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.688562499999996,
      "end": 57.2685625,
      "text": "every murderous group project."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.2685625,
      "end": 58.308562499999994,
      "text": "Would you trust his plan,"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.308562499999994,
      "end": 59.9685625,
      "text": "or confiscate the cloak immediately?"
    }
  ],
